WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.019
Deliberate practice builds skill through specific goals, focused effort, feedback, correction,

00:00:04.019 --> 00:00:05.444
repetition, variation, and measurement.

00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:09.719
It is different from ordinary repetition because every attempt has a purpose.

00:00:09.719 --> 00:00:13.994
It is different from performance because practice creates space to isolate weak

00:00:13.994 --> 00:00:18.269
points and improve them before the learner returns to the full task.

00:00:18.269 --> 00:00:23.613
Strong practice systems target the right subskill and operate near the edge of current ability.

00:00:23.613 --> 00:00:28.245
They use feedback to reveal the gap between current performance and desired performance.

00:00:28.245 --> 00:00:31.095
They correct errors before those errors become habits.

00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:35.370
They repeat the important behavior enough to build fluency and vary the

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.151
conditions enough to support transfer.

00:00:37.151 --> 00:00:40.001
Measurement helps the learner avoid guessing about progress.

00:00:40.001 --> 00:00:42.139
Baselines, rubrics, examples, logs, performance data,

00:00:42.139 --> 00:00:44.276
and decision records all provide evidence.

00:00:44.276 --> 00:00:48.195
The question is not whether practice felt intense or consumed time.

00:00:48.195 --> 00:00:52.470
The question is whether real capability improved and whether the learner is

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.321
better prepared to perform when the work matters.

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:59.239
The final takeaway is that deliberate practice is structured, sustainable improvement.

00:00:59.239 --> 00:01:04.227
It asks learners to choose the skill clearly, practice with attention, seek useful feedback,

00:01:04.227 --> 00:01:07.790
correct deliberately, and keep the system realistic enough to continue.

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.996
The goal is reliable skill growth, not endless strain.

00:01:10.996 --> 00:01:12.421
With the right loop,

00:01:12.421 --> 00:01:16.340
focused effort becomes capability that can travel back into real work.
